/E (Residents in urban and semi-urban communities frequently face infrastructure disruptions such as water supply failures, electricity outages, damaged roads, waterlogging, and internet connectivity issues. Despite the immediate impact of these problems, there is no universally accessible, centralized platform that provides reliable, real-time, location-specific information about such incidents.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
